{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06591","headline":"舟中别武金坛 · 储光羲","name":"舟中别武金坛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曰予轻皎洁，坦率宾混元。\n忽乃异羣萃，高歌信陵门。\n信陵好宾客，清夜开华轩。\n月光丽池阁，野气浮林园。\n偶坐烂明星，归志潜崩奔。\n漾舟清潭里，慰我别离魂。\n落日下西山，左右惨无言。\n萧条风雨散，窅霭江湖昏。\n秋荷尚幽郁，暮鸟复翩翻。\n纸笔亦何爲，写我心中冤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06591.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06591","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}